{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t尼泊爾中北部發生洪水，最少5人失蹤。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n尼泊爾軍方表示，廓爾喀縣有山坡發生山泥傾瀉，泥石一度堵塞布迪甘達基河，之後河道決堤、引發洪水，沿岸數十幢民房損毀。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n軍方出動直升機撤離數十名居民，正在搜索失蹤者。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T10:37:55.696932+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T10:24:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T09:28:10.271899+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"fb981bf86df87a55d427b523b2a1695a5c31478ad99256d6b2fbe6ebfb28aa03","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}